# Skybeast Tracker: "Whenever you cast a spell with mana value 5 or greater, create a Food token" (CR 603.2, 202.3e). The X chosen for a spell on the stack counts, so
# Fireball with X = 4 (mana value 5) makes a Food as it is cast, before it resolves, and Fireball with X = 3 (mana value 4) makes none. Turn 1: the Lotus and the Forest
# pay for the Tracker (casting it does not trigger it); turn 3: Fireball for 4 gets its Food; turn 5: Fireball for 3 does not, and the Moxes and Mox Jet are not spells.
[Bot1 Deck]
Skybeast Tracker
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Fireball
Mox Jet
Fireball
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

